{* Code generated by packages/kit-compose/src/server-organisms.ts from packages/compose-gen/specs (compose-gen organism emitters on kit-compose). DO NOT EDIT.
    Source: packages/compose-gen/specs/organisms/cut-cards.json
    The cards layout of DishCompare: one compare card per cut with a picture, the name, the summary, the weight, heat and price as a description list, and the cooking time.
    Props (p): dishes, labels. *}
{var $v_dishes = ($p['dishes'] ?? null)}
{var $v_labels = ($p['labels'] ?? null)}
{capture $c_15}
